_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-1ee2fb564a5521dc2a8d","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-20ec5cb6c2b431920542","layer":"original","quote":"入为尚书令。奏正分职〖5〗，料简名实，出事使断官府者百五十余条〖6〗。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":367,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":43,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-222658d796d0219a33ae","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-502b20f4034784204e23","layer":"pei","quote":"又潜为兖州时，尝作一胡床；及其去也，留以挂柱。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":379,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-25934e237d9261ff1b2d","start":84,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-3649f67065f7646025c3","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-16aefddfb8d37b8a6699","layer":"original","quote":"正始五年薨，追赠太常，谥曰贞侯。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":368,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-3f26e0c20dc3a30e492d","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-20ec5cb6c2b431920542","layer":"original","quote":"明帝即位，入为尚书。出为河南尹〖3〗。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":367,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-4dda871a8f6ea51cc7aa","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-5eadcca7791db8d302b3","layer":"original","quote":"潜出为沛国相。迁兖州刺史〖19〗。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":342,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-53e7fdff775fbbabd330","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-70b462befe881dec6b24","layer":"original","quote":"在代三年，还为丞相理曹掾〖15〗。太祖褒称治代之功，潜曰：“潜于百姓虽宽，于诸胡为峻〖16〗。今（计）〔继〕者必以潜为（理）〔治〕过严，而事加宽惠；彼素骄恣，过宽必弛；既弛又将摄之以法，此忿争所由生也。以势料之，代必复叛。”于是太祖深悔还潜之速。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":341,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":123,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-6a300828b5d6443ae620","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-79b9afa89af8b3f6c34c","layer":"original","quote":"遂单车之郡〖12〗；单于惊喜。潜抚之以静。单于以下脱帽稽颡〖13〗，悉还前后所掠妇女、器械、财物。潜案诛郡中大吏与单于为表里者郝温、郭端等十余人〖14〗，北边大震，百姓归心。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":340,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-6eb7d7acc2fc492dbdfb","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-5eadcca7791db8d302b3","layer":"original","quote":"太祖次摩陂〖20〗，叹其军阵齐整，特加赏赐。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":342,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":17,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-836b4a2e98a34d929412","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-20ec5cb6c2b431920542","layer":"original","quote":"丧父去官。拜光禄大夫。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":367,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":78,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-857ee2e109cc808687d3","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-76cd3fa5e240d6cca024","layer":"original","quote":"迁荆州刺史，赐爵关内侯。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":366,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":50,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-87df477bd5eaf0498e1a","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-fac926ea651795849354","layer":"original","quote":"裴潜字文行，河东闻喜人也〖1〗。﹝一﹞避乱荆州，刘表待以宾礼。潜私谓所亲王粲、司马芝曰〖2〗：“刘牧非霸王之才〖3〗，乃欲西伯自处〖4〗；其败无日矣！”遂南适长沙。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-8bb6fd7176cf52e9f9dd","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-20ec5cb6c2b431920542","layer":"original","quote":"转太尉军师、大司农〖4〗。封清阳亭侯，邑二百户。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":367,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":19,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-8c381b1edcbde90170b4","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-7b7cc96499dacbccbd15","layer":"original","quote":"时代郡大乱〖7〗，以潜为代郡太守。乌丸王及其大人〖8〗，凡三人〖9〗，各自称“单于”，专制郡事。前太守莫能治正，太祖欲授潜精兵以镇讨之。潜辞曰：“代郡户口殷众，士马控弦〖10〗，动有万数。单于自知放横日久〖11〗，内不自安。今多将兵往，必惧而拒境，少将则不见惮。宜以计谋图之，不可以兵威迫也。”","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":339,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":147,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-baa45ad3dc8cd64b6b04","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-1c6895e8ebdfb82d9242","layer":"original","quote":"太祖问潜曰：“卿前与刘备俱在荆州，卿以备才略何如？”潜曰：“使居中国〖5〗，能乱人而不能为治也；若乘间守险〖6〗，足以为一方主。”","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-d99ebc18c2631edae17d","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-16aefddfb8d37b8a6699","layer":"original","quote":"遗令俭葬：墓中惟置一坐，瓦器数枚，其余一无所设。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":368,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-dd48ca674afab5918753","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-707c9801b4ecec59d138","layer":"original","quote":"太祖定荆州，以潜参丞相军事。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":337,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-e2cf6b033ce81e17474d","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-76cd3fa5e240d6cca024","layer":"original","quote":"出为魏郡、颍川典农中郎将；奏通贡举〖1〗，比之郡国，由是农官进仕路泰〖2〗。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":366,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":12,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-f3b53aeba98ead7dde3e","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-707c9801b4ecec59d138","layer":"original","quote":"出历三县令。入为仓曹属。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":337,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-1044bbd2c5b448daf2ce","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-bbb8a7d1595758446f03","layer":"original","quote":"恢密语潜曰：“此必襄阳之急欲赴之也。所以不为急会者〖11〗，不欲惊动远众；一二日，必有密书促卿进道。张辽等又将被召，辽等素知王意。后召前至，卿受其责矣","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":205,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":231,"end":306,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-1c84f108fba1f8eb0177","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-bbb8a7d1595758446f03","layer":"original","quote":"恢谓兖州刺史裴潜曰〖7〗：“此间虽有贼，不足忧；而畏征南方有变〖8〗。今水生而子孝悬军〖9〗，无有远备；关羽骁锐，乘利而进，必将为患。”于是有樊城之事","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":205,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":133,"end":208,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-67f17a01695c1f34d245","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-bbb8a7d1595758446f03","layer":"original","quote":"潜受其言，置辎重，更为轻装速发，果被促令〖12〗。辽等寻各见召，如恢所策","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":205,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":308,"end":344,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-bd00b9264e01dddc4564","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-bbb8a7d1595758446f03","layer":"original","quote":"诏书召潜及豫州刺史吕贡等。潜等缓之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":205,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":213,"end":230,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0126","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-7c4cb6e3288767c0659f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《世语》曰：“初，荆州刺史裴潜以泰为从事。司马宣王镇宛，潜数遣诣宣王，由此为宣王所知。及征孟达，泰又导军，遂辟泰。泰频丧考、妣、祖，九年居丧；宣王留缺待之。至，三十六日，擢为新城太守。宣王为泰会，使尚书钟（繇）〔毓〕调泰：‘君释褐登宰府，三十六日拥麾盖，守兵马郡；乞儿乘小车，一何驶乎？’泰曰：‘诚有此！君，名公之子，少有文采，故守吏职；猕猴骑上牛，又何迟也！’众宾咸悦。后历兖、豫州刺史，所在有筹算绩效。”","attribution":"世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":435,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-83035962258f184f04f4","start":0,"end":207,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0610","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-7c4cb6e3288767c0659f","layer":"pei","quote":"初，荆州刺史裴潜以泰为从事。司马宣王镇宛，潜数遣诣宣王，由此为宣王所知","attribution":"裴注·世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":435,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-83035962258f184f04f4","start":10,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
